        <mxCell id="cycG4G3_xcY17sgw9jJz-44" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;what POS Interface can Do&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;*Add Item by name&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;*Add item by barcode reader(phone)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;*item can Add to cart&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;*cart item can change qunatity&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;*cart item can add discount&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;*can add discount for hall bill&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;*Cart item can remove if want&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;*Add custom item that not in the item list&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;*hold button can hold bill without lossing it&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;*can save draft mean&amp;nbsp; u can save some item list and add all them in just one click&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
